From dd777caec94cd681283c678063d44054feba10a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nikhil Gupta <nikhil.gupta_2@nxp.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 16:55:32 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Add System Manager board port for the LATU DC-SCM.
Upstream-Status: Pending

Changes vs mcimx95evk reference:
 - New config:  configs/latu_dcsm.cfg
 - Debug UART:  LPUART1 -> LPUART2 (UART2_RXD/UART2_TXD pads)
 - PMIC I2C:    LPI2C1 -> LPI2C6
 - PMIC INTB:   PDM_BIT_STREAM1/GPIO1_IO10 -> SAI1_TXC/GPIO1_IO12
 - Removed:     PCAL6408A I/O expander (not populated on LATU)
 - Removed:     PCA2131 board RTC (not populated on LATU; uses SoC BBNSM RTC)
 - Retained:    PF0900 (VDD_SOC main), PF5301 (VDD_ARM), PF5302 (VDD_SOC aux)
 - DDR:         no change

Signed-off-by: Nikhil Gupta <nikhil.gupta_2@nxp.com>
